  "date": "2010-07-16 00:38:46",
  "excerpt": "At last night's Silicon Valley JavaFX User Group event, I announced a petition to Open Source the JavaFX Platform.  This is a petition from the Java and JavaFX Community directed to the management of Oracle Corporation.  The goal of the petition is to increase the viability of the JavaFX platform to the benefit of both the community and Oracle.\nTo the Leaders, Management, and Board of Directors at Oracle Corporation,",
